@startuml
title Generating and Managing a Recommendation Proposal

skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
autonumber

actor User
participant ApplicationRunner as Runner
participant CommandDispatcher as Dispatcher
participant RecommendCommandParser as Parser
participant RecommendGenerateCommand as Generate
participant RecommendationService as Service
participant RecommendationManager as ProposalStore
participant RecommendationFormatter as Formatter
participant RecommendViewCommand as View
participant RecommendCancelCommand as Cancel
participant ActivityManager as Manager
participant Ui

== Generate preview ==

User -> Runner : recommend date/2099-06-02
Runner -> Dispatcher : dispatch(input, now)
Dispatcher -> Parser : parse(activityManager, preferenceManager,\nrecommendationManager, now, args)
Parser --> Dispatcher : RecommendGenerateCommand
Dispatcher --> Runner : command

note over Runner
  recommend generation is read-only:
  no snapshot, no save, no mutation
  of stored activities.
end note

Runner -> Generate : execute()
Generate -> Service : recommendDate(activityManager, profile, date, now)
Service -> Manager : getAll()
Manager --> Service : activities
Service -> Service : build deterministic placements,\nclamping today's candidates to now,\nand unscheduled IDs
Service --> Generate : RecommendationProposal
Generate -> ProposalStore : setProposal(proposal)
Generate -> Service : applyPreview(activityManager.getAll(), proposal)
Service --> Generate : copied preview activities
Generate -> Formatter : formatPreview(proposal, previewActivities)
Formatter --> Generate : preview text
Generate --> Runner : CommandResult
Runner -> Ui : showFramed(feedback)
Ui --> User : preview shown

== Re-display proposal ==

User -> Runner : recommend view
Runner -> Dispatcher : dispatch(input, now)
Dispatcher -> Parser : parse(...)
Parser --> Dispatcher : RecommendViewCommand
Dispatcher --> Runner : command
note over Runner
  recommend view is read-only:
  no snapshot and no save.
end note
Runner -> View : execute()
View -> ProposalStore : getProposal()
ProposalStore --> View : active proposal
View -> Service : applyPreview(activityManager.getAll(), proposal)
Service --> View : copied preview activities
View -> Formatter : formatPreview(proposal, previewActivities)
Formatter --> View : preview text
View --> Runner : CommandResult
Runner -> Ui : showFramed(feedback)
Ui --> User : preview shown again

== Cancel proposal ==

User -> Runner : recommend cancel
Runner -> Dispatcher : dispatch(input, now)
Dispatcher -> Parser : parse(...)
Parser --> Dispatcher : RecommendCancelCommand
Dispatcher --> Runner : command
note over Runner
  recommend cancel only clears the
  in-memory proposal state. It does
  not snapshot or save files.
end note
Runner -> Cancel : execute()
Cancel -> ProposalStore : clear()
Cancel --> Runner : CommandResult
Runner -> Ui : showFramed(feedback)
Ui --> User : proposal discarded

@enduml
